# Harness-layer filelist snippet — append to <verif_root>/filelist/tb.f
# Order must respect stage1-patterns.md § 1.3.
#
# Assumptions:
#   - Interfaces already exist under <verif_root>/testbench/top/if/
#   - Shared packages (<PREFIX>_tb_pkg / <PREFIX>_pack_pkg) already compiled before this snippet
#   - UVC packages compiled AFTER this snippet's harness_api_pkg but BEFORE env_pkg
#
# Add these ranges into an existing tb.f — do not use standalone unless tb.f is fresh.

# +incdir for tb_harness svh
+incdir+<verif_root>/testbench/top/harness/tb_harness

# 1) Interfaces — harness_if joins the ones under top/if/
<verif_root>/testbench/top/harness/tb_harness/<PREFIX>_harness_if.sv

# 4a) tb_harness API package (BEFORE env_pkg; env_cfg references its aggregate class type)
<verif_root>/testbench/top/harness/tb_harness/<PREFIX>_harness_api_pkg.sv

# 7) DUT-side harness modules (AFTER all packages)
<verif_root>/testbench/top/harness/dut_harness/<PREFIX>_rtl_wrap.sv
<verif_root>/testbench/top/harness/dut_harness/<PREFIX>_dut_select.sv
<verif_root>/testbench/top/harness/dut_harness/<PREFIX>_dut_harness.sv

# 8) Assertion checker module stubs (AFTER dut_harness so bind targets resolve at elab)
# >>> GENERATED_CHECKER_FILES <<<
